        {
          "title": "Sharp Oracle-Regret Tradeoffs for Projection-Free Online Convex Optimization",
          "title_zh": "无投影在线凸优化的紧致 oracle-遗憾权衡",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2610.00254v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_top",
          "organization": "MiniMax",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2610.00254",
          "summary": "The paper characterizes minimax expected regret for online convex optimization when the feasible set is accessible only through an exact linear optimization oracle, giving a dimension-free bound of Theta(GD max{sqrt(T), T/(1+min{Q,BT})^{1/4}}) for G-Lipschitz convex losses with diameter D, total budget Q, and per-round cap B, with a matching counted approximate-gradient method. Total-budget and strict per-round guarantees follow as special cases, including the T^{3/4} rate with one call per round and the quadratic total budget needed for sqrt(T) regret.",
          "keywords": [
